# What Heal becomes while Righteously Indignant is switched on: the Cleric's
# emergency heal traded for a six-enemy swing. It sits in Heal's row of the
# Cleric's book and is learned to whatever level Heal was bought to, so it
# costs nothing of its own -- see Skill.replaces_skill_name.
#
# GMS climbs 250+5x over twenty levels; ten here, ending exactly where GMS
# ends. The defence it strips off what it hits is dropped: nothing here holds
# a condition on a monster.
name: "Angelic Wrath"
skill_order: 3
description:
  "Calls down an avenging angel to strike the enemy. Enemies struck will be "
  "weakened."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_VENGEANCE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CLERIC
max_level: 10
replaces_skill_name: "Heal"
toggle_skill_name: "Righteously Indignant"
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 660
max_enemies: 6
lines: 5
base { skill_pct: 2.60 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.10 }
